 rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 24%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" class="heading-large text-style-all-caps primary-font text-align-right margin-top margin-huge">Social Media</h2><div data-w-id="7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef38" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, -81%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, -81%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, -81%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, -81%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);width:0%" class="image-work modal"></div></div><div class="content-section padding-horizontal padding-xxhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid grdi-2-columns modal margin-vertical margin-huge"><div id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef3b-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font text-style-all-caps">context </div><p id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef3d-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font">The Connaught Bar enters you into another world. Conversation flows over sparkling glasses and candlelit tables. Behind the bar, mixologists conjure up new concoctions and time-honoured classic cocktails.<br/></p></div></div><div data-w-id="7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef3f" class="_100wh-section"><div class="display-flex-horizontal"><div data-w-id="7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef41" class="move-image"><img src="images/635147bcc25ec9484faee205_connaught_bar_01.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" srcset="images/635147bcc25ec9484faee205_connaught_bar_01-p-500.webp 500w, images/635147bcc25ec9484faee205_connaught_bar_01-p-800.webp 800w, images/635147bcc25ec9484faee205_connaught_bar_01.webp 1000w" alt="" class="main-image modal"/><img src="images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" srcset="images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square-p-500.webp 500w, images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square-p-800.webp 800w, images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/635147bcac54423045ae6348_connaught_bar_3_007-square.webp 1920w" alt="" class="main-image modal"/><img src="images/6351698ae94e852b48381f1d_easid-7719258.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 507px) 100vw, 507px" srcset="images/6351698ae94e852b48381f1d_easid-7719258-p-500.jpeg 500w, images/6351698ae94e852b48381f1d_easid-7719258.jpeg 507w" alt="" class="main-image modal"/></div></div><div class="display-flex-horizontal"><div data-w-id="7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef46" class="move-image second"><img src="images/63514644ac54420260ae5185_Worlds-Best-Bar-2016_Connaught-Bar-London_Spirited-Awards-_Tales-of-the-Cocktail_02-1200x675.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" srcset="images/63514644ac54420260ae5185_Worlds-Best-Bar-2016_Connaught-Bar-London_Spirited-Awards-_Tales-of-the-Cocktail_02-1200x675-p-500.jpeg 500w, images/63514644ac54420260ae5185_Worlds-Best-Bar-2016_Connaught-Bar-London_Spirited-Awards-_Tales-of-the-Cocktail_02-1200x675-p-800.jpeg 800w, images/63514644ac54420260ae5185_Worlds-Best-Bar-2016_Connaught-Bar-London_Spirited-Awards-_Tales-of-the-Cocktail_02-1200x675-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, images/63514644ac54420260ae5185_Worlds-Best-Bar-2016_Connaught-Bar-London_Spirited-Awards-_Tales-of-the-Cocktail_02-1200x675.jpeg 1200w" alt="" class="main-image modal"/><img src="images/6351481eb47261365b1ebaa5_Connaught-2-.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px" srcset="images/6351481eb47261365b1ebaa5_Connaught-2--p-500.jpeg 500w, images/6351481eb47261365b1ebaa5_Connaught-2-.jpeg 620w" alt="" class="main-image modal"/></div></div></div><div class="content-section padding-horizontal padding-xxhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid grdi-2-columns modal margin-vertical margin-huge"><div id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef4b-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font text-style-all-caps">BRIEF</div><p id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef4d-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font">The Connaught Bar won The Worlds Best Bar two years running 2020 and 2021. We were asked to create a video showcasing their signature drink; The martini, and capturing the philosopy that made the bar a global institution </p></div></div><div class="row display-flex-horizontal padding-horizontal padding-xhuge"><img class="main-image _50" src="images/635171b4bb335971f9a8e362_106986065-1638924213486-Agostino_Perrone_1.jpeg" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" loading="lazy" srcset="images/635171b4bb335971f9a8e362_106986065-1638924213486-Agostino_Perrone_1-p-500.jpeg 500w, images/635171b4bb335971f9a8e362_106986065-1638924213486-Agostino_Perrone_1.jpeg 760w"/><div class="w-layout-grid grdi-2-columns modal second"><div id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef55-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font text-style-all-caps">-</div><p id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef57-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font">-</p></div></div><div data-w-id="7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bef59" class="colosed-button"><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(45deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(45deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(45deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(45deg) skew(0, 0)" class="line top"></div><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, -1px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(-45deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3