ass="main-image modal"/></div></div></div><div class="content-section padding-horizontal padding-xxhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid grdi-2-columns modal margin-vertical margin-huge"><div id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bf007-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font text-style-all-caps">3d prototype/</div><p id="w-node-_7323c15e-90ab-3efc-9250-26be235bf009-20607372" class="text-size-regular secondary-font">We created comprehensive branding and marketing strategy for NWRS. Assisting with their successful fund raise and launch strategy. A key focus of NWRS is their personal client advocacy, our strategy showcases the insurance experts, emphasising accessibility for the clients and transparency.</p></div></div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="slider-work w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="mask w-slider-mask"><div data-w-id="80dd6d1c-f376-6b1f-082f-4d6eb1195ee2" class="slide-5 w-slide"><div data-w-id="80dd6d1c-f376-6b1f-082f-4d6eb1195ee3" class="container-image-2"><img class="work-image" src="images/6351972c21f59981e3286d4d_Screenshot-2022-10-20-at-19.43.37.png" alt="" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0.71" sizes="(max-width: 2372px) 100vw, 2372px" data-w-id="80dd6d1c-f376-6b1f-082f-4d6eb1195ee4" loading="lazy" srcset="images/6351972c21f59981e3286d4d_Screenshot-2022-10-20-at-19.43.37-p-500.png 500w, images/6351972c21f59981e3286d4d_Screenshot-2022-10-20-at-19.43.37-p-800.png 800w, images/6351972c21f